  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "Daily Safety Tips",
      "cn": "第 34 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "To be safe in your daily life, you need to know many things.",
      "cn": "为了在日常生活中保持安全，你需要知道很多事情。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "Here are some of them.",
      "cn": "这里有其中一些。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "Always be careful about what’s around you.",
      "cn": "始终留意你周围的情况。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "You shouldn’t walk alone outside at night.",
      "cn": "你不应该夜里独自在外面走。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "Make sure you know where the police stations are.",
      "cn": "确保你知道警察局在哪里。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "If anything dangerous happens, you can find them easily.",
      "cn": "如果发生危险的事情，你可以很容易地找到它们。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "Carry your bag in front of your body; do not put it on your back.",
      "cn": "把包背在身前，不要背在背上。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "When a bus is full of people, it is easy for someone else to steal things from your bag.",
      "cn": "当公交车上挤满人时，别人很容易从你的包里偷东西。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "If someone is after you and you don’t know him or her, go across the street, go in another direction, and let the person know that you realise he or she is after you.",
      "cn": "如果有人跟着你，而你不认识他或她，就穿过街道，换一个方向走，并让那个人知道你已经意识到他或她在跟着你。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "Next, don’t go home right now.",
      "cn": "接下来，不要马上回家。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "You are safer in the street than alone at home or in a lift.",
      "cn": "在街上比独自待在家里或电梯里更安全。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
